    {
        "text": "11:45 P.M. \\ Cloudy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Downtown Lungmen, Cafe Al Fresco"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.4
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "A pleasant aroma"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "To enjoy such a lovely al fresco cafe, with a sandwich, by candlelight, as the people go by, with the fragrance of sweet candy,"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "It would be a truly relaxing experience were it not for this young lady staring daggers into me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "...I just happened to be walking by. But that thing you have in your hand isn't the kind of thing that can be explained by happenstance."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "I have explained. Mostima is acting in her capacity as an employee of Penguin Logistics, and I am helping her guard the staff in her absence."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "You think I'm going to let some freak who talks to her staff off the hook?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "F- freak...? Let's just pretend you didn't see that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "She will be fine."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "I'm not worried about her."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "Nor will she make trouble."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "...I hope you're right."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_300_phenxi_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_035",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_035"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Yith",
        "text": "...... (Perhaps I should just stay in the hotel.)"
    },
