        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.4
    },
    {
        "command": "playmusic",
        "params": {
            "intro": "$penguinlogistics_intro",
            "key": "$penguinlogistics_loop",
            "volume": 0.8,
            "crossfade": 1.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "fadetime": 0.5,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#4",
            "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bison",
        "text": "*Pant* *pant* Are those guys mobsters too? How much farther do we have to run?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#4",
            "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Definitely not. They might be some of those thugs we ran into before. There's too many of them. Don't want to think about it. Just run. We can lose them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#4",
            "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bison",
        "text": "But I just saw a guy running at us with a rolling pin..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
            "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "That's how these fights usually go. You don't come to the slums often?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Sometimes they end up rolling some blood or teeth into the dough, and then a customer gets all pissed off when he bites into somebody else's tooth."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
            "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bison",
        "text": "I really didn't need such a detailed explanation."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bison",
        "text": "...Have you known Mostima for a long time?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
            "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "You're getting pretty friendly with me now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
            "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bison",
        "text": "Mostima said she was testing me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#3",
            "name2": "char_325_bison_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Oh? I never heard about that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
