    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_101_sora_1#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "That's justified self-defense. Don't sweat it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#8",
            "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Hey! Texas~"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1",
            "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "You're okay. But where's Mostima?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
            "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Do you really have to ask? She Mostima'd."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#7",
            "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Texas",
        "text": "Oh. Sorry."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1",
            "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "What are you sorry about? And what are you all looking at me for?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_101_sora_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "Ahaha... Mostima came back. We'll see her again sooner or later."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Sora",
        "text": "But first, we should probably deal with these new bad guys..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "So what's this all about?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Some kinda revenge for us bein' too rowdy?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai",
        "text": "Maybe."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_103_angel_1#4",
            "name2": "char_325_bison_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bison",
        "text": "Maybe?! Are the slums always this violent?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_201_moeshd"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Croissant",
        "text": "Can't make friends if you don't throw down. Talkin' with yer fists is the oldest form of communication!"
    },
